(), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ())]), ([()], [((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ())]), ([()], [((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ())]), ([()], [((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ()), ((), (), (), ())]), [()], (), (), ());   // Content of DB "ServiceControlBlockMediumSetup"
      tempProcStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index
      tempProcEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index
      temp16InitIndex : Int;   // Variable is used to initialize the Digital & String para index
      tempProcStartingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Starting state
      tempProcStartingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Starting state
      tempProcRunningStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Running state
      tempProcRunningEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Running state
      tempProcHoldingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Holding state
      tempProcHoldingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Holding state
      tempProcUnHoldingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for UnHolding state
      tempProcUnHoldingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for UnHolding state
      tempProcUnPausingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Pausing state
      tempProcUnPausingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Pausing state
      tempProcResumingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Resuming state
      tempProcResumingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Resuming state
      tempProcCompletingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Completing state
      tempProcCompletingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Completing state
      tempProcStoppingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Stopping state
      tempProcStoppingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Stopping state
      tempProcAbortingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Aborting state
      tempProcAbortingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Aborting state
      tempProcResettingStartIndex : Int;   // Procedure start index for Resetting state
      tempProcResettingEndIndex : Int;   // Procedure end index for Resetting state
      temp16IndexOfDefinitionProcessOut : Int;   // Index of Definition array
      temp16IndexOfDefinitionProcessIn : Int;   // Index of Definition array
      temp16IndexOfDefinitionReport : Int;   // Index of Definition array
      temp16IndexAnalog : Int;   // Pointer for the used analog parameter
      temp16IndexDigital : Int;   // Pointer for the used digital parameter
      temp16IndexBinary : Int;   // Pointer for the used binary parameter
      temp16IndexString : Int;   // Pointer for the used string parameter
      temp16ReturnValueOBNum : Int;   // Internal work variable for Return Value
      tempTopSi {InstructionName := 'SI_none'; LibVersion := '1.0'} : SI_none;   // Start-up information of current OB
      tempStartSi {InstructionName := 'SI_none'; LibVersion := '1.0'} : SI_none;   // Start-up information of last started OB
      temp16ObNo : UInt;   // OB number
      xOB_Start : Bool;   // block is running in start OB
      temp16ReturnStatus : Word;   // Internal work variable for Return Value
      tempDTLCurrentTime {InstructionName := 'DTL'; LibVersion := '1.0'} : DTL;   // Current time stamp
   END_VAR

   VAR CONSTANT 
      CONFIG_PARAMETER_MIN : Int := 0;   // Minimum  number of configuration parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      CONFIG_PARAMETER_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of configuration parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      CONFIG_PARAMETER_ANALOG_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of analog configuration parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      CONFIG_PARAMETER_DIGITAL_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of digital configuration parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      CONFIG_PARAMETER_BINARY_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of binary configuration parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      CONFIG_PARAMETER_STRING_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of string configuration parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCEDURE_PARAMETER_MIN : Int := 0;   // Minimum  number of procedure parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCEDURE_PARAMETER_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of procedure parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCEDURE_PARAMETER_ANALOG_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of analog procedure parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCEDURE_PARAMETER_DIGITAL_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of digital procedure parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCEDURE_PARAMETER_BINARY_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of binary procedure parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCEDURE_PARAMETER_STRING_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of string procedure parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      NUMBER_OF_CONTROLMODULES_IN_DW_MIN : Int := 0;   // Number of control modules coded in DWords (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      NUMBER_OF_CONTROLMODULES_IN_DW : Int := 0;   // Number of control modules coded in DWords (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      NUMBER_OF_CONTROLMODULES_MIN : Int := 0;   // Number of control modules (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      NUMBER_OF_CONTROLMODULES : Int := 29;   // Number of control modules (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      TYPE_NONE : USInt := 0;   // No parameter
      TYPE_ANALOG : USInt := 1;   // Parameter / value type analog
      TYPE_DIGITAL : USInt := 2;   // Parameter / value type digital
      TYPE_BINARY : USInt := 3;   // Parameter / value type binary
      TYPE_STRING : USInt := 4;   // Parameter type string
      NUMBER_OF_PROCEDURES_MIN : Int := 0;   // Number of operations (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      NUMBER_OF_PROCEDURES : Int := 15;   // Number of operations (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PARAMETERINDEX_MIN : Int := 0;   // Minimum  number of configuration parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PARAMETERINDEX_MAX : Int := 511;   // Maximum number of configuration parameters (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      REPORT_VALUES_MIN : Int := 0;   // Minimum  number of report values (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      REPORT_VALUES_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of report values (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      REPORT_VALUES_ANALOG_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of analog report values (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      REPORT_VALUES_DIGITAL_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of digital report values (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      REPORT_VALUES_BINARY_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of binary report values (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      REPORT_VALUES_STRING_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of string report values (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_IN_MIN : Int := 0;   // Minimum  number of process values in (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_IN_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of process values in (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_IN_ANALOG_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of analog process values in (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_IN_DIGITAL_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of digital process values in (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_IN_BINARY_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of binary process values in (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_IN_STRING_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of string process values in (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_OUT_MIN : Int := 0;   // Minimum  number of process values out (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_OUT_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of process values out (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_OUT_ANALOG_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of analog process values out (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_OUT_DIGITAL_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of digital process values out (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_OUT_BINARY_MAX : Int := 31;   // Maximum number of binary process values out (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      PROCESS_VALUES_OUT_STRING_MAX : Int := 7;   // Maximum number of string process values out (planned number -1 due to ArrayAddressing)
      MAPPED_CONFIG_ANALOG : Int := 0;   // Mapped configuration analog parameter count
      MAPPED_CONFIG_DIGITAL : Int := 0;   // Mapped configuration digital parameter count
      MAPPED_CONFIG_BINARY : Int := 1;   // Mapped configuration binary parameter count
      MAPPED_CONFIG_STRING : Int := 0;   // Mapped configuration string parameter count
      MAPPED_PROCEDURE_ANALOG : Int := 2;   // Mapped procedure analog parameter count
      MAPPED_PROCEDURE_DIGITAL : Int := 0;   // Mapped procedure digital parameter count
      MAPPED_PROCEDURE_BINARY : Int := 0;   // Mapped procedure binary parameter count
      MAPPED_PROCEDURE_STRING : Int := 0;   // Mapped procedure string parameter count
      MAPPED_PROCESS_IN_ANALOG : Int := 1;   // Mapped process In analog values count
      MAPPED_PROCESS_IN_DIGITAL : Int := 0;   // Mapped process In Digital values count
      MAPPED_PROCESS_IN_BINARY : Int := 1;   // Mapped process In Binary values count
      MAPPED_PROCESS_IN_STRING : Int := 0;   // Mapped process In String values count
      MAPPED_PROCESS_OUT_ANALOG : Int := 1;   // Mapped process Out analog values count
      MAPPED_PROCESS_OUT_DIGITAL : Int := 0;   // Mapped process Out digital values count
      MAPPED_PROCESS_OUT_BINARY : Int := 0;   // Mapped process Out binary values count
      MAPPED_PROCESS_OUT_STRING : Int := 0;   // Mapped process Out string values count
      MAPPED_REPORT_ANALOG : Int := 1;   // Mapped report analog values count
      MAPPED_REPORT_DIGITAL : Int := 0;   // Mapped report digital values count
      MAPPED_REPORT_BINARY : Int := 0;   // Mapped report binary values count
      MAPPED_REPORT_STRING : Int := 0;   // Mapped report string values count
   END_VAR


BEGIN
	    REGION Copyright, Change Log
	(*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
