	    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	    Functionality provided by this source (short description):
	    Function block to handle the Parameters mapped/used in the project from the engineering tool.
	    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	    Status: Preliminary,
	    Preliminary (experimental)
	    Baselined  
	    Released
	    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	    File name:              ServiceParameter.SCL
	    Function block name:    "ServiceParameterFB"
	    System :                SIMATIC S7 CPU (1500)
	    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	    Restrictions, known limitations: (e.g. only for certain platforms, ...)
	    The provided source code is applicable to the CPUs of the S7 1500 series
	    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	    Requirements, prerequisites, external resources used: (e.g. hardware,
	    technological package, memory needed, other scripts which are included,
	    other objects instantiated, other applications (e.g. MS Excel) assumed, ...)
	    TIA Version V19
	    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	    Change log table (latest change is at the bottom of the list):
	     Version  | Date       | Expert in charge        | Changes applied
	    ----------|------------|-------------------------|-----------------------------
	     00.00.01 | 06.03.2024 | Kumaraguru M            | first implement  
	     00.00.11 | 26.03.2024 | Kumaraguru M            | BugFix - 682100 - SPFL Library: When the user creates a procedure without assigning a step in the transit state, and after downloading the file to PLC, PLC goes into STOP mode.  
	     03.00.01 | 07.04.2024 | Kumaraguru M            | Feature -676519: Process In value view for Service Control Block 
	     03.00.01 | 07.04.2024 | Kumaraguru M            | Feature -676521: Process Out value View for Service Control Block 
	     03.00.01 | 07.04.2024 | Kumaraguru M            | Feature -676524: Report Value View for Service Control Block
	    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	     27.04.2024 - Changed the FB from Type to Master Copy for Memory and Power Tag Optimization
	     08.05.2024 - Change : Bug 702554: SPFL: Service Control Block: In the runtime, when the user has not selected a procedure, then the ProcessIn, Processout, and Report parameters are listed.
	     08.05.2024 - Change : Bug 700381: SPFL: SPFL Library: When the user engineers the “ServiceParameterHMI” block icon, the interface tag names are not in uniform.
	     12.05.2024 - Change : Bug 702859: SPFL: Service Control Block: In the configuration windows, the parameter values are continuously updated.
